/// Decide the precedence used to parse the operand of a unary `+` or
/// `-` sign, i.e. how tightly the sign binds to the expression that
/// follows it.
///
/// Only infix operators with a strictly greater precedence are parsed
/// as part of the operand; operators with lower or equal precedence
/// apply to the result of the unary operation instead.
///
/// The default implementation preserves the historical behavior of
